# ---- Generated pipeline artifacts (recreated by running the tools) ----

# The index (`cuts chapters` / `cuts coalesce`), and write_events' temp file.
*.events.json
.events_*.json

# Pass 1 output, and the temp file it is written through. Worth ignoring on
# its own terms, not just as build output: every observation carries the OCR
# text read off the screen at that instant, and the header carries the speech
# transcript, so this is a running record of whatever was captured.
# Credentials in it have been through cuts.redact, but that reduces exposure
# rather than guaranteeing it (see cuts/redact.py), and the rest is still
# your screen.
*.observations.jsonl
*.observations.jsonl.tmp

# Chapter lists saved from the GUI.
*.chapters.txt

# Output of earlier versions of the tool (shot detection, the removed search
# index, the first refinement experiment). Kept locally, never committed.
dummy.json
refine_experiment/
retrieval_index/

